<title>POLAND: Polish Q2 preliminary amounts of bonds on offer.</title>
<headline>Polish Q2 preliminary amounts of bonds on offer.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry on Wednesday announced preliminary amounts of bonds it would offer in the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>NOTE: All amounts in million zlotys. The actual amount of bonds on offer is announced a week before the tender.</p>
<p> DATE		 BOND TYPE			BOND SYMBOL AMOUNT</p>
<p> April 2	    fixed 2-yr			  AS0699	800</p>
<p>			fixed 5-yr			  OS0602</p>
<p> April 8	    floating 10-yr		    DZ0407	400</p>
<p>			floating 10-yr assimilated    DZ0406	300</p>
<p> April 17	   fixed 5-yr assimilated	  OS0601	200</p>
<p> April 22	   floating 3-yr		     TZ0500	700</p>
<p> April 23	   index-linked 1-yr		 RP0698	200</p>
<p> April 24-May 7   subscription for index-linked 1-yr IR0698 900</p>
<p> May 5-July 31    public sale of floating 3-yr	 TZ0500 400</p>
<p> May 7		fixed 2-yr			 AS0699	 800</p>
<p>			fixed 5-yr			 OS0602</p>
<p> May 15	     fixed 5-yr assimilated	 OS0601	 200</p>
<p> May 21	     index-linked 1-yr		RP0698	 200</p>
<p>June 3-August 29 public sale index-linked 1-yr IR0698 max 900*  June  4	    fixed 2-yr			 AS1099	 800</p>
<p>			fixed 5-yr			 OS1002</p>
<p> June 11	    floating 10-yr		   DZ0707	 600</p>
<p> June 19	    fixed 5-yr assimilated	 OS0601	 200</p>
<p>* bonds not sold in subscription -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
